  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**JetStream is where the platform's work actually queues.** Three of the ten streams are work queues — `MEDIA`, `SITES`, `EMAIL` — and a backlog on one of those is a user-visible delay: an unprocessed upload, an unbuilt site, an unsent password reset.\n\n`AUDIT` is the exception to every rule here. It is `limits` retention with `--discard new`, deliberately: an audit publisher must see an error rather than have its message silently trimmed. The consequence is that a full AUDIT stream starts *refusing* audit writes, which is why its size has its own alert."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Server up",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "dcms-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "dcms-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "gnatsd_varz_start > bool 0",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "up",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "down",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "up",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "no data from nats-exporter"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
